{"createdAt":"2026-10-01T03:25:30.135Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"何をしたらいいのかわからない"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"今大学に通っているわけだけど、何をしたらいいかわからなくなるときがある"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p5","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p4","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"1点突破か、広く浅くか？"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"p7","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p6","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"1つのことを極めていく、っていうのを去年とかまでやってたわけで、ソフトウェア開発などをやっていた。大学にもそれで入った。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p9","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p8","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"でも最近は、ハードウェアとかやってたりするし、テーマもバラバラになって来ている"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pb","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pa","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"大学生活"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pd","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pc","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"今後何をすべきなんだろう"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pf","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pe","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"なんか、今後何をやってもAIに食われていく気がしているので、ぶっちゃけ最近は、1つのことを究めるという気力が起きていないし、研究とかも、特定の分野にこだわったことをやるような気が起きなくなってしまった。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"date_precision":"day","description":"何をやったらいいかわからなくなるときがある自分","emoji":"❓","hidden_from_listing":true,"is_work_in_progress":true,"properties":{},"published_updated_at":"2026-05-02T00:00:00.000Z","title":"キャリアについての悩み","translation":null},"id":"01M3TQXT4QQ443KC99MFBQHNJY","locale":"ja","publishedAt":"2026-05-02T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":true,"title":null},"slug":"my-career-path","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9F7FY1GFDY2YD68CSPVN","label":"雑記","locale":"ja","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"misc","translationGroup":"01M40J9EZG7N7XMZG3TAFYBE98"}],"tag":[{"id":"01M40J9RKAYMSYMEEQVNB914XS","label":"essay","locale":"ja","n